### Click the ▶ next to a request (IntelliJ / VS Code "REST Client").
### The response time is shown with each response, and in the app console.

### ---------------- Exercise 1: the slow plan catalogue ----------------

### Manual cache-aside (ManualPlanService). Run it twice: ~1000 ms, then ~5 ms
GET http://localhost:8080/ex1/plans/basic

### @Cacheable version (AnnotatedPlanService)
GET http://localhost:8080/ex1/annotated/plans/basic

### A plan that doesn't exist -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/ex1/plans/does-not-exist


### ---------------- Exercise 2: prices change ----------------

### 1. View the plan (caches it)
GET http://localhost:8080/ex2/plans/unlimited

### 2a. Change the price - invalidate on write (default strategy)
PUT http://localhost:8080/ex2/plans/unlimited/price?strategy=evict
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyPrice": 59.99 }

### 2b. Change the price - write-through
PUT http://localhost:8080/ex2/plans/unlimited/price?strategy=write-through
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyPrice": 49.99 }

### 3. View it again: is the price new? Was it a hit or a miss?
GET http://localhost:8080/ex2/plans/unlimited

### Annotated versions (@CacheEvict / @CachePut)
GET http://localhost:8080/ex2/annotated/plans/family-4

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/ex2/annotated/plans/family-4/price?strategy=write-through
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyPrice": 149.00 }


### ---------------- Exercise 3: the account that changes one field at a time ----------------

### Hash model (HashAccountCache) - the default
GET http://localhost:8080/ex3/accounts/acc-1001

### Only the data usage
GET http://localhost:8080/ex3/accounts/acc-1001/usage

### Record 250MB of usage
POST http://localhost:8080/ex3/accounts/acc-1001/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mb": 250 }

### String model (StringAccountCache) - compare in RedisInsight
GET http://localhost:8080/ex3/accounts/acc-1001?model=string

###
POST http://localhost:8080/ex3/accounts/acc-1001/usage?model=string
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mb": 250 }


### ---------------- Bonus A: leaderboard ----------------

### Generate 500 random sign-ups
POST http://localhost:8080/bonus-a/signups/simulate?count=500

### Top plans from Redis (fast)
GET http://localhost:8080/bonus-a/plans/top?limit=3

### Top plans from the database (slow GROUP BY)
GET http://localhost:8080/bonus-a/plans/top-from-db?limit=3
